{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38424","headline":"败帘六韵 · 吴融","name":"败帘六韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有客编来久，弥年断不收。\n不堪风作候，岂复燕爲讐。\n尽见三重阁，难迷百尺楼。\n伴灯微揜梦，兼扇劣遮羞。\n零落亡珠缀，殷勤谢玉钩。\n凉宵何必卷，月自入轩流。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38424.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38424","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}